## ⚡ ANIMATION SYSTEM

### **Mandatory Micro-Interactions**
Every interactive element MUST include:

```tsx
// Button Animations
'transition-all duration-200 ease-out hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-lg'

// Card Animations  
'transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1'

// Input Focus
'transition-all duration-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500/20 focus:border-blue-500'

// Loading States
'animate-pulse' OR 'animate-spin' OR custom shimmer

// Page Transitions
'transition-opacity duration-500 ease-out'
```

### **Professional Animation Classes**
```tsx
// Subtle Entrance Animations
'animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-4 duration-700'
'animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-left-4 duration-500'

// Hover Effects
'group hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-200'
'hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-500/10 transition-all duration-300'

// Interactive Feedback
'active:scale-95 transition-transform duration-100'
'focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2'
```

